<section id="S5.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">5.3 </span>Memory Efficiency Analysis</h3>

<div id="S5.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We evaluate memory efficiency across three architectures—KGERMAR, ERMAR, and MemLong—testing context lengths from 1K to 32K tokens on WikiText-103 using an NVIDIA L40S GPU (44.4GB). Results in Table <a href="#S5.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ 5.3 Memory Efficiency Analysis ‣ 5 Results and Discussion ‣ Knowledge Graph Enhanced Memory-Augmented Retrieval for Long Context Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> and Figure <a href="#S5.F3" title="Figure 3 ‣ 5.3 Memory Efficiency Analysis ‣ 5 Results and Discussion ‣ Knowledge Graph Enhanced Memory-Augmented Retrieval for Long Context Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> reveal KGERMAR’s superior memory characteristics across three key metrics.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S5.T3" class="ltx_table">
<table id="S5.T3.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
